{"4438080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Call It a Day", "steam_appid": 4438080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438080/extras/3b90d22ca92d34e06561bedd86c5df09.avif?t=1785148433\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call It a Day is a physics-based online co-op game where you and your friends play as the world's worst renovation crew. Drag the couch up the stairs, water down the paint and throw the trash out the window - but don't work too hard. Cracking open a cold one with the boys is also part of the job.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HARDLY WORKING TOGETHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work, slack off, and argue together in full online co-op with proximity voice chat. Grab the task list from your boss and find a way to get the job done with as little effort as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438080/extras/68669f4b94aa3cc7f714382be87309f5.poster.avif?t=1785148433\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438080/extras/68669f4b94aa3cc7f714382be87309f5.webm?t=1785148433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438080/extras/68669f4b94aa3cc7f714382be87309f5.mp4?t=1785148433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BEER BREAKS INCLUDED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The work isn't going anywhere. If things are slowing down, it's time for a break. Grab a beer, have a smoke and relax with your crew. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438080/extras/7ee67ddedfe6e0a5837cd3a0de1dea33.poster.avif?t=1785148433\" width=1170 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438080/extras/7ee67ddedfe6e0a5837cd3a0de1dea33.webm?t=1785148433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438080/extras/7ee67ddedfe6e0a5837cd3a0de1dea33.mp4?t=1785148433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EASTERN EUROPEAN AESTHETIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A place stuck in time. Taxes are high, inflation is higher, and your boss says business is slow - right before buying himself a new car. Welcome home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438080/extras/bd987ee084b64637f15ba0089adffe69.poster.avif?t=1785148433\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438080/extras/bd987ee084b64637f15ba0089adffe69.webm?t=1785148433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438080/extras/bd987ee084b64637f15ba0089adffe69.mp4?t=1785148433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 - 4 player online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything can go wrong</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=